    {
      "attribution": null,
      "body": "IMPORTANT RESERVATION INFORMATION:\n\n- GENERAL RESERVATIONS: Reservations for 1-8 guests are available 28 days in advance starting at 10:00 a.m.\n\n- LIMITED SEATINGS: All tables are reserved for a scheduled amount of time: 1.75 hours for parties of 2 guests, 2 hours for parties of 3-5 guests and up to 2.5 hours for parties of 6-8 guests. Please arrive on time with your completed party. If you're running late by more than 10 minutes, please notify us and be aware that your dining time may be shortened in order to accommodate the next scheduled reservation.\n\n- COURTYARD RESERVATIONS: Courtyard seating is open-air and weather permitting. We recommend dressing in layers as San Francisco weather varies and heating coverage is limited.\n\n- STRICT CANCELLATION POLICY:  We require 24 hours notice for free cancellations. Cancellations and re-bookings within 24 hours are subject to a cancellation/no-show fee of $50/person. \n\n- LARGE PARTIES: Groups of 6-8 adults are required to order our nightly set menu @ $90/person. Larger parties of 9+ adults are required to make a reservation through our events page and participate in a banquet menu (izakayarintaro.com/events). Parties must be complete in order to be seated.\n\n- ALLERGIES: If there are any strict allergies or dietary restrictions in your party, please notify us in case we need to make special accommodations.\n\n- SERVICE FEE: Parties of 6+ are subject to a 20% service charge in lieu of gratuity.\n\nIf you have any questions or need to reach a member of our team, please email info@izakayarintaro.com or call (415) 589-7022. If your call is not answered, please be sure to leave a voice message.",
      "display": {
        "type": "text"
      },
      "icon": {
        "url": "https://s3.amazonaws.com/resy.com/images/icons/info.svg"
      },
      "locale": {
        "language": "en-us"
